| desc = [[Root]] sources applied on {{H|Magnus}} do not interrupt the ability if already charging.
}}

 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|magnataur_skewer_movement}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} 
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}} [[File:Dota2 Magnus Skewer Visualized icon-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Magnus Skewer Visualized icon-2.png|84px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
*#** Applies the following ability effects on self while moving from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] :
*#*** {{M|Disarm}}
*#*** {{M|Stun}}
*#*** {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*#**** [[Forced Movement|Moves]] Magnus a min {{#expr:{{#vardefineecho:Skewer int|({{#var:Skewer type1 value1}}*{{G|tick rate}} round2)}}}}-distance per {{M|server tick}} to the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location.
*#***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|DistanceMoved {{=}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]] MaxSkewerDistance × SkewerSpeed / [[Server Tick|ServerTick]] [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌋]]}}
*#**** This affects the following things:
*#***** The {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted distance must be a factor of the aformentioned distance moved per server tick.
*#***** Hence, the ability has a {{#expr:{{#var:Skewer int}}}}-min Skewer distance, and has an actual {{calc|trunc (v1/{{#var:Skewer int}})*{{#var:Skewer int}}|v1={{#var:Skewer value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|trunc (v1/{{#var:Skewer int}})*{{#var:Skewer int}}|v1={{#var:Skewer value2 shd}}}}|shd}})-max distance.
*#****** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|MinDistance < [[Abilities#Target Point|Point]]Distance < MaxDistance}}, Skewer moves Magnus toward the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted distance.
*#** {{Symbol|Trees}}
*#*** [[Trees]] are destroyed within {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 200-radius of Magnus while charging.
*#* The ability can be interrupted by the following sources applied to Magnus:
*#** {{M|Disable}} sources, except {{M|silence}} sources.
*#** Upon Magnus' {{M|death}}.
*#** Applying another {{M|forced movement}} source on Magnus while charging.
*#* When interrupted, Skewer prematurely applies all ability effects at the debuff-affected unit's current location.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|magnataur_skewer_impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Applies the following ability effects on all debuff-affected enemy heroes within Skewer radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] :
*#** The ability component {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
*#** {{hi|Magnus}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Teleport}}
*#*** Offensively [[teleport]]s enemy heroes to Magnus' front upon contact, according to his {{M|facing angle}}.
*#** {{M|Stun}}
*#** {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*#*** [[Forced Movement|Drags]] all affected enemy heroes for the entire Skewer duration.
*#*** Can charge through and drag enemy heroes over {{M|impassable terrain}}. 
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#** Offensively {{M|teleports}} all dragged enemy heroes 200-distance in front of Magnus at the end of the Skewer.
*#** Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|magnataur_skewer_slow}} to all affected enemy heroes.
*#** {{Symbol|Trees}}
*#*** Trees are destroyed within 400-radius, centered around Magnus, at the end of the Skewer duration.
*# Applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} as one damage instance in the {{M|combat log}}. This is defined as:
*#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SpellDmg {{=}} {{#var:Skewer value3}} + ({{#var:Skewer value4}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Magnus|v3l}}|tal|x}}) × MovedDistance + (Destroyed[[Tree]] × {{ValueColor||{{#var:Skewer type2 value1 shd}}|shd|x}} + CollidedCliff × {{ValueColor||{{#var:Skewer type2 value2 shd}}|shd|x}})}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Skewer icon0}}
| desc = Magnus rushes forward, goring enemy units on his massive tusk. Heroes hit on the way will be dragged to the destination, then damaged and affected by slowed movement speed. The damage is increased based on distance traveled.
}}

